and defeated enemies in a quest to rescue the princesses Puripuri and Puchipuchi. Four years later, the sequel, Snow Bros. 2: With New Elves—a game as quirky and bizarre as it was wonderfully entertaining—was released. But despite the love for the first two Snow Bros. games, we haven’t had a true third entry in the series. Until now.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for? Let’s grab some friends and dive into the snowy fun!</p>", "short_description": "Winter is coming. Snow Bros. is back in this brand-new adventure by Tatsujin!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "reviews": "78/100 – Hobby Consolas<br><br>7.5/10 – Vandal<br><br>“Snow Bros. Wonderland is a blast from the past with a modern aesthetic. This 3D platformer combines puzzles, fighting, and a touch of magic. Moreover, it is great with friends. If you love the original, you'll adore the latest title in the franchise.”<br>8/10 – Movies Games and Tech<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214870/header.jpg?t=1770803584", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214870/ce3f9b123a94ee027ca8dc49e9f1ce97bc9d0815/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770803584", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3214870/ce3f9b123a94ee027ca8dc49e9f1ce97bc9d0815/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770803584", "website": "http://snowbroswonderland.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</st